RustPilot is an independent Rust migration effort based on ArduPilot.
Upstream: https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot
Baseline: afeb9c4941543d97f3e04fecf257b8f598f49a6a

Credit belongs to the ArduPilot contributors and the authors of the original
components. The upstream repository and commit history identify their work.
RustPilot does not imply affiliation with or endorsement by ArduPilot.

Derived sources:
  libraries/AP_Math/crc.cpp
  libraries/AP_Math/crc.h
  libraries/Filter/LowPassFilter.cpp
  libraries/Filter/LowPassFilter.h
  libraries/AP_Math/AP_Math.cpp (calc_lowpass_alpha_dt and floating is_equal)
  libraries/Filter/FilterClass.h
  libraries/Filter/FilterWithBuffer.h
  libraries/Filter/AverageFilter.h
  libraries/Filter/ModeFilter.h
  libraries/Filter/ModeFilter.cpp
  libraries/Filter/DerivativeFilter.h
  libraries/Filter/DerivativeFilter.cpp
  libraries/Filter/Butter.h
  libraries/Filter/LowPassFilter2p.cpp
  libraries/Filter/LowPassFilter2p.h
  libraries/AP_Math/vector2.h and vector2.cpp (selected arithmetic, predicates, magnitudes and geometry)
  libraries/AP_Math/vector3.h and vector3.cpp (selected arithmetic, predicates, magnitudes and geometry)
  libraries/AP_Math/AP_Math.h and ftype.h (magnitude helpers, predicates and precision rules)

